yunohost (12.1.41.34) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: rename the native admin/SSO/API web surface from /yunohost/*
    to /nostrhost/* and fix SPA asset serving.
    - build_portal_routes() now serves the admin and portal SPAs with Caddy
      try_files semantics (real files first, index.html fallback) instead of an
      unconditional rewrite, which returned the HTML shell for every asset and
      rendered the admin SPA blank.
    - /yunohost/api|portalapi|sso|admin routes, the conf.d template, the nuxt
      portal baseURL/customassets, and the crowdsec login-path scenarios all
      now use /nostrhost/* (the /package/* native-API path is unchanged).
    - admin SPA base path is now /nostrhost/admin/ (VITE_BASE_URL + packaging
      base_path); the nostrhost.admin / nostrhost.portal session cookies and
      the nostrhost-login/nostrhost-link challenge actions match.

 -- NostrHost <noreply@nostrhost.org>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:19:01 

